## Шаблон: Еженедельный отчёт планировщика

```markdown
# Backlog Update — Week of Apr 7, 2026

## Completed Tasks
- ✅ TASK-003: Deployment & Smoke Testing (approved by tech-lead)

## In Progress
- 📋 TASK-004: CI/CD Pipeline (Backend working, 60% done)

## Next Up
- ⏳ TASK-005: Kubernetes Migration (planned, deps on TASK-004)

## Velocity
- Average: 0.9 (tasks taking 10% longer than estimated)
- Trend: Stable (last 3 tasks ≈ 0.9)

## Risks
- TASK-004 backend might slip 1 day (complexity higher than expected)
- Mitigation: Tech-lead to review & reallocate if needed

## Backlog Status
- Total: 17 tasks
- Phase 1 (MVP): 3/3 DONE ✅
- Phase 2 (Stabilization): 1/7 in progress, 6/7 planned
- Phase 3+ (Future): backlog
```

